-- V8: commodity reference data with in-repository official evidence (owner module: commodity).
--
-- Scope (explicit): a SUBSET of the official Agmarknet 2.0 commodity master. ADR-0006 makes the full
-- master (605 names in 16 groups) the known list; it is not stored in this repository, so loading it is
-- a seed-preparation step that remains open (docs/database/SEED_AND_REFERENCE_DATA.md section 4). This
-- migration seeds only the commodities whose exact official name, official commodity group and price
-- unit are evidenced by official DMI material available in the repository or recorded in the decision log:
--   * the five Agmarknet 2.0 'Commodity-wise, Market-wise Daily Report (Weighted Average)' exports for
--     01-Oct-2026 (41 commodity headings; the report-only '(MSP: ...)' annotation is removed, ADR-0006);
--   * the Agmarknet 2.0 'Marketwise Price & Arrival Report' export for 01-10-2026 (15 commodities, 9 not
--     in the first set);
--   * Onion, Potato and Tomato: the Agmarknet 2.0 Market-wise dashboard, 'Price (Rs./Quintal)', Vegetables
--     group, retrieved 2026-10-03 and recorded as VERIFIED evidence in ADR-0008.
-- Every row states its unit 'Rs./Quintal' with that evidence (ADR-0008 item 1). Localized names are not
-- seeded: no curated list with provenance exists yet (ADR-0015), so clients fall back to the English name.
-- Commodities outside this subset are rejected by ingestion as UNKNOWN_COMMODITY until the full master is
-- loaded or an admin adds them with official evidence (ADR-0006 item 2, ADR-0020).
-- Generated from the files above by a parser that also checked every data row's unit is 'Rs./Quintal'.

ON CONFLICT (canonical_name) DO NOTHING;
